<div class="container-fluid">
<div class="row">
<div class="col s12" style="font-size: x-large;">
<h1 class="source-h2" id="main-content" style="margin-top: 0%;" tabindex="-1">Who we are</h1>
</div>
<div class="col s12" style="font-size: x-large;">
<strong>We bring the best of what we do to our customers and consumers, as center of our reason to be, based on an omnichannel and sustainability strategy.</strong>
</div>
<div class="col s12" style="padding-top: 2%; padding-block-end: 2%;">
<p style="font-size: large;font-weight: 300;">
                                                        We are a Colombian company, producer and distributor of apparel and fashion brands, with a business model, structured under these four business lines:
                                                        <a href="/Spinning" style="color: #4c4c4c;"><u>Spinning</u></a>, 
                                                        <a href="/FullPackage" style="color: #4c4c4c;"><u>Full package</u></a>, 
                                                        <a style="color: #4c4c4c;"><u>Industry</u></a>, <a href="/marcas" style="color: #4c4c4c;"><u>Brands</u></a>, 
                                                        with nearly ninety years of experience in the market, founded by three Colombian entrepreneurs, Octavio Echavarría Hernández, Julio Echavarría Hernández and Alfredo Mesa Vélez, who in the decade of the thirties, bet on their dream of building a company, consolidating it under the name Zigzag, which was dedicated to produce socks for children.
                                                        <br/>
<br/>
                                                        After the liquidation of Zigzag, Alfonso Velasquez Velez, Octavio and Julio Echavarria Hernandez, in 1948 Calceteria Victoria was born, until the beginning of the fifties, when the Echavarria Hernandez brothers opened the Crystal Socks Factory, located in Barrio Antioquia in the city of Medellin, establishing the foundations of what would become one of the largest companies in the industry within the country. 
                                                    </p>
</div>
<div class="col s12">
<div class="col l1 m12 s12">
</div>
<div class="col l2 m4 s12" style="padding-top: 2%; padding-block-end: 4%;">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-image center">
<img data-aos="fade-down" src="/static/store/images/quienesSomos/Julio_Echavarria_Hernandez.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"/>
