<div class="col l2 m4 s12" style="padding-top: 2%; padding-block-end: 4%;">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-image center">
<img data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="650" src="/static/store/images/quienesSomos/Luis_Fernando_Restrepo_Echavarria.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"/>
</div>
<div class="card-action center" style="padding: 1%;">
<h6 style="font-size: small;">Luis Fernando Restrepo Echavarría</h6>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col l2 m4 s12" style="padding-top: 2%; padding-block-end: 4%;">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-image center">
<img data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="850" src="/static/store/images/quienesSomos/Juan_Carlos_Echavarria_Zuluaga.png" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"/>
</div>
<div class="card-action center" style="padding: 1%;">
<h6 style="font-size: small;">Juan Carlos Echavarría Zuluaga</h6>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col l1 m12 s12">
</div>
</div>
<div class="col s12">
<p style="font-size: large;">
                                                        After years of growth and development; and after the death of Octavio Echavarría Hernández, his son, Carlos Manuel Echavarría Toro, assumed the Presidency of the Company, contributing with his ingenuity and knowledge of the industry, in the accelerated process of growth of the Organization, which allowed diversifying the business, boosting the exports, expanding the production chain, acquiring own stores and thus strengthening the brands:
                                                        <a href="https://www.gef.com.co/" style="color: #4c4c4c;" target="_blank"><u>Gef</u></a>, 
                                                        <a href="https://www.puntoblanco.com.co/" style="color: #4c4c4c;" target="_blank"><u>Punto Blanco</u></a>, 
                                                        <a href="https://tienda.babyfresh.com.co/" style="color: #4c4c4c;" target="_blank"><u>Baby Fresh</u></a>, 
                                                        <a href="https://www.galax.co/" style="color: #4c4c4c;" target="_blank"><u>Galax</u></a> y 
                                                        <a href="https://www.mediascasino.com/" style="color: #4c4c4c;" target="_blank"><u>Casino</u></a>, which today are synonymous of quality, innovation and design, both nationally and internationally. 
                                                        <br/>
<br/>
                                                        Constant, honest and intelligently executed work over the years, by a highly committed and competitive human capital, and wisely directed for nearly two decades by its current Corporate President Luis Fernando Restrepo Echavarría, and his cousin and Executive President Juan Carlos Echavarría Zuluaga, have allowed this Company, which has not been oblivious to the changes in the environment, to continue to be a symbol of trust and quality in the market, thus building relationships of mutual growth with employees, their families and the country.  
                                                        <br/>
<br/>
                                                        Crystal now have over 270 stores in  Colombia, 6 high-performance manufacturing plants, and are present in 11 countries throughout Latin America with our own brands Gef, Punto Blanco, Baby Fresh, Galax and Casino and our franchise Parfois, which are synonymous with quality, Innovation and design, both domestically and internationally.
We take the best of what we do to our customers as they are at the center of our core which is based on an omnichannel and sustainable strategy.
                                                    </p>
